{'symbol': 'CEG', 'date': '2022-09-21 08:27:00', 'title': 'PPG TO POWER ADRIAN, MICHIGAN, AUTOMOTIVE ADHESIVES, SEALANTS MANUFACTURING FACILITY WITH CLEAN ENERGY BY 2024; ADVANCES DECARBONIZATION EFFORTS', 'text': "PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PPG (NYSE:PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED A 1.5 MEGAWATT (MW) AGREEMENT WITH CONSTELLATION (NASDAQ: CEG) THAT WILL HELP PPG PURCHASE CLEAN, RENEWABLE ENERGY EQUIVALENT TO THE ANNUAL ELECTRICITY USE OF ITS ADRIAN, MICH., AUTOMOTIVE ADHESIVES AND SEALANTS MANUFACTURING FACILITY BEGINNING IN 2024. THROUGH A 12-YEAR AGREEMENT, PPG WILL RECEIVE ENERGY AND PROJECT-SPECIFIC RENEWABLE ENERGY CERTIFICATES (RECS) FROM SWIFT CURRENT ENERGY'S DOUBLE BLACK DIAMOND SOLAR ENERGY PROJECT. THI"}